# RainDog Wine Website

Welcome to the RainDog Wine website repository

## Features

- Responsive design
- About Us section
- Contact form

## Tech Stack

- HTML, CSS, JavaScript

## Setup

1. Clone the repo: `git clone https://github.com/M-Walker32/raindog.git`
2. Navigate: `cd raindog`
3. Install extension: Live Server: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=ritwickdey.LiveServer
4. Start server: click the Go Live icon in the right bottom corner

